--- a/doc-build/md024.md
+++ b/doc-build/md024.md
@@ -30,5 +30,15 @@ headings with different parents (as is common in changelogs):
 ### Features
 ```
 
+If the parameter `ignore_case` is set to `true`, headings whose text differs
+only in letter case are treated as duplicates (GitHub generates the same anchor
+for them):
+
+```markdown
+# Install
+
+## install
+```
+
 Rationale: Some Markdown parsers generate anchors for headings based on the
 heading name; headings with the same content can cause problems with that.
